  "releaseNotes": "Adds .NET 11 target assets to all runtime libraries while retaining their existing target frameworks. BlazorComponents adds .NET 10 and .NET 11 assets alongside .NET 8. The CLI remains a .NET 8 tool with major-version roll-forward: including both tool frameworks duplicates native dependencies and exceeds NuGet.org's 250 MB package limit. .NET 8 and .NET 11 runtime-only execution are verified. No public API, runtime package dependencies, or speech pipeline defaults change. All twelve packages are released together.",
